00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.380
I was just endorsed by ICE”

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:01.880
Nuh-uh.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:02.740
“I don’t know Putin.”

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:03.280
Nope.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.060
“Some of the media is terrific,

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:11.700
but most of it 70 to 75% is absolute dishonest, absolute scum.”

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:17.060
According that same study, “86.2% of reporters
are very sad losers with the worst ratings.”

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.780
Yet, there is some truth to media suckage.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:23.960
Sometimes the media sometimes stoops to Trump’s
level and makes a bunch of unforced errors.

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.780
Here’s a list of several facts the media
got wrong about Trump.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.620
This isn’t Diet Coke!

