outlets.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:41.360
This misinformation is then disseminated by
your well-meaning but hysterical

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.060
Trump-hating friends on social media.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:47.240
Its part of a phenomenon called “Trump
Derangement Syndrome” or TDS.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.380
Now, unfortunately, TDS is a term coined by
the alt-right,

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.080
but hey, even a racist clock is alt-right
