00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:59.140
"You filthy fascist scumbag liberals allied
with radical Islam!

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.420
You people are filth and you know it."

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:02.720
Trump Derangement Syndrome

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:06.310
is when people are so blinded by their rage
against Trump

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:10.409
that they don’t check their facts and reflexively
oppose anything he likes.

00:03:10.409 --> 00:03:12.380
Do you suffer from TDS?

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:17.500
Symptoms may include: aneurysms, sore throat,
hair removal, myopia, pussy hat rash,

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:21.780
Twitter frenzy, Hitler comparisonitis, chronic
over-posting, jump cuts,

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:26.620
jump cuts, hyperbole, hyperventilation, hysteria,
hyper-bole-vent-isteria.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:31.900
TDS is caused by: alarmism, cherry-picking
data, confirmation bias, asshole-reflux,

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.180
inflated opinion, clickbait fatigue, or a
rush to publish.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:39.460
If you suffer from TDS, ask your doctor to
tell you to stop it.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.680
Just stop it, Jesus!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.700
The worst part is, no one needs to suffer
from TDS!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.100
Because there’s no need to exaggerate!

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:51.600
Trump already says and does terrible, stupid things.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:56.260
It’s like spreading a rumor that the Gymnastics
molester also hates black history month!

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.120
He’s already a bad guy.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.260
We don't need to make stuff up!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.879
But the difference between Trump and the media
is that Trump lies all the time

00:04:02.879 --> 00:04:04.390
and we’ve come to expect it.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.400
Trump’s lies are obvious and self-serving.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:10.080
Here’s an analogy:

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.860
What makes you think I ate it?

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.209
But the media’s misreporting is more subtle.

00:04:14.209 --> 00:04:18.920
And when the media slacks off, it bolsters
Trump’s accusations of fake news,

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:22.520
which confirms his supporters’ suspicions
of media bias,

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:25.780
and emboldens him to keep citing “alternative”
facts.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.080
Which in turn enrages the media.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.580
Which in turn enrages Trump.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.460
So it’s a feedback loop.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:36.940
Within a repetitive cycle, circulating within
a self-propagating continuous system.

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.260
Or am I?!?!

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:42.500
The way out of that cycle is for the media
to not slack off.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:47.660
And since that probably isn’t gonna happen
anytime soon, readers should always be skeptical.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.920
As Supreme Court Justice Abraham Lincoln once
said,

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.680
“Don’t believe everything you see on the internet.”

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.940
